== Lambdas ==
More concise code
+ Anonymous, functions
+ Needs a functional interface (one abstract method)
Syntax:
(parameter) -> {expression}
(Car car) -> car.getYear < 2006  (returns boolean)
s -> System.out.println(s) (when doesn't return anything)

== Functional Interfaces ==

= Predicate =
Returns boolean

= BiPredicate =
Same logic, two values

= Consumer =
Without return
s -> System.out.println(s)

= Function =
Function<T, R> -> receives a type T and return type R
name -> name.length()
.apply -> to create an object from R

= BiFunction =
Receives T, U and returns R
(title, episodes) -> new Anime(title, episodes) / Anime::new

= Supplier =
To give an object, without parameters (lazy initialization)

== Method Reference ==
To simplify lambdas, when calls once method
String::toLowerCase
AnimeComparators::compareByTitle

When non static -> new AnimeComparators()::compareByTitle